#: lib/database.tcl:107
#, tcl-format
msgid ""
"This repository currently has approximately %i loose objects.\n"
"\n"
"To maintain optimal performance it is strongly recommended that you compress "
"the database.\n"
"\n"
"Compress the database now?"
msgstr ""
"Repositori ini kini mempunyai kira-kira %i objek longgar.\n"
"\n"
"Untuk mengekalkan prestasi optimum sangat disarankan anda mampatkan "
"pangkalan data.\n"
"\n"
"Mampatkan pangkalan data sekarang?"

